# Study plan: multinomial logistic regression vs k-nearest neighbours on Iris

Owner: `story-repo` (plan). Objective: `story-repo`#1. Who delivers which path: `assignment.json`.
Inputs used: feasibility assessment `idea-review-repo` `feasibility.md` (4d8e155, request `story-repo`#2);
venue requirements V1-V7 `venue-repo` `venue-requirements.md` (70f36b7, `story-repo`#4);
report layout proposal `story-repo`#3; context brief `idea-repo` `brief.md` (2001400, requirement IDs
D1-P6 there map onto §6 here).

